42
00:01:47,920 --> 00:01:48,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Blood...</font>

43
00:01:55,130 --> 00:01:56,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama!</font>

44
00:01:57,880 --> 00:02:02,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Hey! What's happening?!</font>

45
00:02:02,390 --> 00:02:05,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why's Kabuto-san fighting
with Granny Tsunade?!</font>

46
00:02:06,020 --> 00:02:08,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take a good look at the headband!</font>

47
00:02:09,600 --> 00:02:11,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's Orochimaru's subordinate.</font>

48
00:02:13,980 --> 00:02:20,950
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Eat It!</font>

49
00:02:13,980 --> 00:02:20,950
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Rasengan of Anger</font>

50
00:02:31,290 --> 00:02:33,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That man is Orochimaru...</font>

51
00:02:33,880 --> 00:02:36,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shizune, you take care of
the guy with the glasses...</font>

52
00:02:37,220 --> 00:02:39,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll take care of Orochimaru.</font>

53
00:02:42,680 --> 00:02:48,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Before that, I'd like to have Tsunade
do something about this body.</font>

54
00:02:48,770 --> 00:02:52,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The effects of that drug
might still last for awhile...</font>

55
00:02:52,770 --> 00:02:54,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's nothing that
I can do about it.</font>

56
00:02:55,070 --> 00:02:57,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? Really?</font>

57
00:02:57,690 --> 00:02:59,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez. I guess it can't be helped.</font>

58
00:03:00,490 --> 00:03:02,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have no choice
but to fight in this condition.</font>

59
00:03:03,620 --> 00:03:07,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade... Rest your body
with Recovery Ninjutsu.</font>

60
00:03:07,790 --> 00:03:09,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then... What about me, me?</font>

61
00:03:09,960 --> 00:03:14,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guard Tsunade together
with that pig.</font>

62
00:03:15,040 --> 00:03:18,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! I want to fight, too.
Even I can...</font>

63
00:03:18,670 --> 00:03:19,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, you won't!</font>

64
00:03:20,130 --> 00:03:22,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like that four-eyed kid said, right?</font>

65
00:03:22,720 --> 00:03:24,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're on a different level.</font>

66
00:03:25,300 --> 00:03:28,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The opponent is a Sannin like myself,</font>

67
00:03:28,140 --> 00:03:30,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and the man who killed
the Third Hokage.</font>

68
00:03:31,020 --> 00:03:35,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">An eye for an eye...
I'm the only one who can fight him.</font>

69
00:03:36,480 --> 00:03:40,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And that four-eyed guy possesses
the same level of power as Kakashi.</font>

70
00:03:42,200 --> 00:03:43,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay.</font>

71
00:03:43,700 --> 00:03:45,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then... Shadow Clo...</font>

72
00:03:45,450 --> 00:03:46,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hold it!</font>

73
00:03:46,870 --> 00:03:50,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't use the Shadow Clone Jutsu.
It'd be utterly pointless.</font>

74
00:03:51,040 --> 00:03:51,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

75
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:55,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It wouldn't even become
much of a diversion...</font>

76
00:03:55,880 --> 00:03:58,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It'd be a waste of Chakra...</font>

77
00:04:00,970 --> 00:04:03,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with them as opponents.</font>

78
00:04:05,720 --> 00:04:08,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then, let's get this thing started.</font>

79
00:04:19,980 --> 00:04:21,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Summoning Jutsu.
— Summoning Jutsu.</font>

80
00:04:39,920 --> 00:04:40,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hi.</font>

81
00:04:41,380 --> 00:04:43,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Huh?!
— What is this?!</font>

82
00:04:43,670 --> 00:04:45,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Wha...?!
— What the hell's going on?!</font>

83
00:04:45,510 --> 00:04:47,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Long time no see.</font>

84
00:04:47,550 --> 00:04:48,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">On account of the drug,</font>

85
00:04:48,680 --> 00:04:51,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jiraiya-sama still can't build up
Chakra very well.</font>

86
00:04:54,270 --> 00:04:58,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It looks like your stupid
still hasn't healed, eh, Jiraiya.</font>

87
00:04:58,400 --> 00:05:03,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's too much even for you
with no ability.</font>

88
00:05:03,990 --> 00:05:07,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems Tsunade got you
with something.</font>

89
00:05:07,530 --> 00:05:10,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A sacrifice was necessary for that Jutsu,</font>

90
00:05:10,830 --> 00:05:13,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so perhaps she was thinking ahead
and drugged him</font>

91
00:05:13,500 --> 00:05:16,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with something that
would contain his power.</font>

92
00:05:16,920 --> 00:05:19,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think she'd make
a sacrifice of Jiraiya...</font>

93
00:05:20,380 --> 00:05:24,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, it sounds just like Tsunade.</font>

94
00:05:25,880 --> 00:05:28,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think I'd already have
my handicap spotted.</font>

95
00:05:31,100 --> 00:05:34,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are such
a disgraceful guy as always...</font>

96
00:05:35,180 --> 00:05:39,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it. It kind of ticks me off
when the Pervy Sage is mocked.</font>

97
00:05:41,860 --> 00:05:43,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Summoning... Jutsu!</font>

98
00:05:46,450 --> 00:05:49,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Nine-Tailed Fox kid
from the Chunin Exam.</font>

99
00:05:50,160 --> 00:05:53,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if I should've killed him then,
after all.</font>

100
00:05:54,250 --> 00:05:56,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For the sake of the Akatsuki organization,</font>

101
00:05:56,960 --> 00:05:59,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I acknowledged his achievement...
and let him slide by.</font>

102
00:06:00,250 --> 00:06:03,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But the only ones who can break
a Five-Pronged Spell</font>

103
00:06:03,420 --> 00:06:07,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">are the Sannin members
and the Third Hokage.</font>

104
00:06:07,380 --> 00:06:10,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Which means Jiraiya-sama may have
already taught it to Naruto-kun.</font>

105
00:06:11,930 --> 00:06:13,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Perhaps.</font>

106
00:06:13,760 --> 00:06:17,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If he's able to control
the Nine-Tailed Fox's power...</font>

107
00:06:19,560 --> 00:06:21,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh...</font>

108
00:06:21,440 --> 00:06:22,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Th-This is...</font>

109
00:06:27,950 --> 00:06:30,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It doesn't quite look to be so.</font>

110
00:06:32,490 --> 00:06:36,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He isn't endowed with Shinobi ability
to begin with, so...</font>

111
00:06:37,290 --> 00:06:38,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why?</font>

112
00:06:41,330 --> 00:06:43,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's still got a long way to go,
sure enough.</font>

113
00:06:45,000 --> 00:06:47,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why?!</font>

114
00:06:48,840 --> 00:06:50,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hello.</font>

115
00:06:54,310 --> 00:06:58,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Gamatatsu.
Why did you come out?</font>

116
00:07:00,350 --> 00:07:03,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, Gamakichi nii-chan.</font>

117
00:07:03,860 --> 00:07:06,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the first time I've been Summoned.</font>

118
00:07:06,320 --> 00:07:08,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I wonder if I can do my best?</font>

119
00:07:08,990 --> 00:07:12,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idiot. Get some snacks
or something and hide.</font>

120
00:07:13,030 --> 00:07:17,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? I can get snacks?
Goody-goody.</font>

121
00:07:18,080 --> 00:07:19,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here I go.</font>

122
00:07:22,120 --> 00:07:23,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll take Jiraiya.</font>

123
00:07:24,500 --> 00:07:27,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I leave the rest to you.</font>

124
00:07:27,630 --> 00:07:28,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's unfortunate...</font>

125
00:07:29,510 --> 00:07:33,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here I also wanted to fight Jiraiya-sama,
one of the Sannin.</font>

126
00:07:57,580 --> 00:07:58,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

127
00:08:00,290 --> 00:08:02,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your opponent is me.</font>

128
00:08:07,170 --> 00:08:09,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Earth Style! Dark Swamp!</font>

129
00:08:19,310 --> 00:08:24,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it. I can't completely sink them
with such a puny swamp.</font>

130
00:08:25,270 --> 00:08:27,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The drug is still working.</font>

131
00:08:28,270 --> 00:08:32,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... with this, the snakes can't move.</font>

132
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:44,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art! Poison Fog!</font>

133
00:08:47,040 --> 00:08:48,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll be up a creek if
I take even one breath.</font>

134
00:09:01,720 --> 00:09:03,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My leg tendons...!</font>

135
00:09:09,480 --> 00:09:12,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't be eaten twice...!
No way!</font>

136
00:09:28,790 --> 00:09:29,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here I go.</font>

137
00:09:35,590 --> 00:09:38,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art! Needle Jizo!</font>

138
00:09:43,310 --> 00:09:46,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it... The Jutsu isn't working well.</font>

139
00:09:47,520 --> 00:09:51,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if we both have handicaps,
you won't one-up me...</font>

140
00:09:51,980 --> 00:09:54,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give up now.</font>

141
00:10:31,520 --> 00:10:32,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's unfortunate...</font>

142
00:10:33,110 --> 00:10:36,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here I had respected you
as a fellow Medical Ninja.</font>

143
00:10:37,150 --> 00:10:39,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop. Stay back!</font>

144
00:10:39,740 --> 00:10:42,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please hang on, Tsunade-san...</font>

145
00:10:42,950 --> 00:10:48,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Sannin name, which Orochimaru-sama
is also called, will cry.</font>

146
00:10:53,670 --> 00:10:55,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My body's heavy.</font>

147
00:10:58,800 --> 00:11:02,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think you who were
once called the village madness</font>

148
00:11:02,970 --> 00:11:07,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">would ferry around such a kid
and struggle tirelessly for the village.</font>

149
00:11:07,770 --> 00:11:09,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've really fallen, haven't you?</font>

150
00:11:09,480 --> 00:11:14,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have a keen eye to discern ability.</font>

151
00:11:16,150 --> 00:11:21,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And that kid... is mediocrity in my eyes.</font>

152
00:11:22,820 --> 00:11:28,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's precisely for this reason...
that I don't need the Uchiha kid.</font>

153
00:11:28,790 --> 00:11:33,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's no fun raising a genius
who's good from the start.</font>

154
00:11:35,290 --> 00:11:37,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you can't leave him alone</font>

155
00:11:37,670 --> 00:11:39,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">because it's like you're looking
at your old self?</font>

156
00:11:40,420 --> 00:11:47,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That kid can't beat Uchiha who inherited
the inherent Sharingan Shinobi skill.</font>

157
00:11:47,850 --> 00:11:52,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And that's because Naruto-kun
doesn't possess the Sharingan.</font>

158
00:11:52,310 --> 00:11:54,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shinobi ability is about whether</font>

159
00:11:54,190 --> 00:12:00,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">one can use and master
all the Jutsu of the world.</font>

160
00:12:00,650 --> 00:12:05,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja refers to one
who can use Ninjutsu.</font>

161
00:12:09,080 --> 00:12:12,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shinobi ability is no such thing.</font>

162
00:12:13,670 --> 00:12:15,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You still don't get it?</font>

163
00:12:16,790 --> 00:12:21,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Ninja... is one who endures.</font>

164
00:12:23,050 --> 00:12:24,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a difference of opinion, huh.</font>

165
00:12:26,300 --> 00:12:28,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll teach you one thing.</font>

166
00:12:29,970 --> 00:12:33,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's most important for Shinobi ability...</font>

167
00:12:34,140 --> 00:12:37,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">isn't the number of Jutsu
one possesses.</font>

168
00:12:38,070 --> 00:12:40,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's important is...</font>

169
00:12:42,400 --> 00:12:44,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The mettle...</font>

170
00:12:44,280 --> 00:12:46,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">not to give up.</font>

171
00:12:56,880 --> 00:13:00,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Enough already... you jerk!</font>

172
00:13:14,180 --> 00:13:17,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The mettle to never give up...</font>

173
00:13:18,230 --> 00:13:20,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He possesses that.</font>

174
00:13:40,130 --> 00:13:43,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heh. I don't know what Jutsu you learned,</font>

175
00:13:43,550 --> 00:13:46,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but you can't hit me with
such a large motion.</font>

176
00:13:49,180 --> 00:13:50,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No good.</font>

177
00:13:50,510 --> 00:13:53,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It won't easily hit with
a moving opponent.</font>

178
00:13:57,310 --> 00:13:59,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ouch!</font>

179
00:14:00,310 --> 00:14:03,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And the Chakra isn't
completely held, yet...</font>

180
00:14:04,490 --> 00:14:07,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems you got a cracked thigh bone
in your left leg</font>

181
00:14:07,650 --> 00:14:09,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">from the battle with the snake.</font>

182
00:14:11,120 --> 00:14:13,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, you can still move if
it's just the bone.</font>

183
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:16,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it's impossible now...</font>

184
00:14:17,250 --> 00:14:20,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The lateral vastus muscle
in your right leg is totally cut off.</font>

185
00:14:22,130 --> 00:14:24,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What should I do...?</font>

186
00:14:24,380 --> 00:14:27,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Jutsu of mine uses both hands.</font>

187
00:14:27,170 --> 00:14:29,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If even one arm is taken out, it's over.</font>

188
00:14:32,760 --> 00:14:35,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you scared of me?</font>

189
00:14:35,770 --> 00:14:37,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you want to run away from here?</font>

190
00:14:42,400 --> 00:14:45,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun, as I recall,</font>

191
00:14:45,110 --> 00:14:48,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you said this
during the first Chunin Exam.</font>

192
00:14:49,740 --> 00:14:52,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't mess with me. I won't run away!</font>

193
00:14:55,120 --> 00:14:58,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"Don't mess with me. I won't run away."</font>

194
00:14:58,710 --> 00:15:02,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"I'll take it. Even if I'm a Genin for
life..."</font>

195
00:15:02,500 --> 00:15:06,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"I'll become the Hokage at any cost,
so it's okay with me."</font>

196
00:15:06,550 --> 00:15:07,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"I'm not scared."</font>

197
00:15:08,920 --> 00:15:11,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can you say the same thing
right now?</font>

198
00:15:14,180 --> 00:15:15,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Unlike you...</font>

199
00:15:15,510 --> 00:15:20,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will be the heir to the Hokage name
no matter what!</font>

200
00:15:23,360 --> 00:15:25,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Hokage is my dream!
— Hokage is my dream!</font>

201
00:15:29,490 --> 00:15:33,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're not a kid anymore,
so you shouldn't act like one.</font>

202
00:15:34,280 --> 00:15:35,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Depending on the situation,</font>

203
00:15:35,530 --> 00:15:38,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">when you want to give up and run away,
you should run away.</font>

204
00:15:44,790 --> 00:15:47,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh my... What's with that look?</font>

205
00:15:48,380 --> 00:15:51,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll die! If you die,
there are no dreams or anything...</font>

206
00:15:55,390 --> 00:15:56,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you want to die?</font>

207
00:15:57,310 --> 00:16:01,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're still a Genin,
so you should run away on the battlefield.</font>

208
00:16:02,690 --> 00:16:05,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't tell a man to run away.</font>

209
00:16:30,510 --> 00:16:33,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kids think that everything is easy.</font>

210
00:16:33,970 --> 00:16:37,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why they talk about foolish dreams
like nothing at all.</font>

211
00:16:37,850 --> 00:16:40,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why they can't give up.</font>

212
00:16:51,190 --> 00:16:55,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jiraiya, was it you
who taught him that Rasengan?</font>

213
00:16:56,280 --> 00:17:00,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you acting like a teacher by teaching
a Jutsu that can't be learned?</font>

214
00:17:00,830 --> 00:17:02,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't give him false hopes.</font>

215
00:17:03,080 --> 00:17:08,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why the oblivious kid starts joking
that he'll become the Hokage!</font>

216
00:17:15,550 --> 00:17:19,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They chase after foolish dreams...
and then die.</font>

217
00:17:19,760 --> 00:17:23,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I have three days,
I'll master that Jutsu.</font>

218
00:17:24,940 --> 00:17:26,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then let's make a bet.</font>

219
00:17:37,240 --> 00:17:39,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bastard!</font>

220
00:17:41,660 --> 00:17:45,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As for me... I stand by my words.</font>

221
00:17:47,420 --> 00:17:51,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's... my Ninja Way!</font>

222
00:17:56,970 --> 00:17:58,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A bet?</font>

223
00:17:58,680 --> 00:18:00,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll give you one week.</font>

224
00:18:00,600 --> 00:18:03,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you can master that Jutsu,</font>

225
00:18:03,470 --> 00:18:06,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll acknowledge that
you'll be able to become the Hokage...</font>

226
00:18:06,480 --> 00:18:08,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and give you this necklace.</font>

227
00:18:11,440 --> 00:18:13,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You should've just
stayed out of this...</font>

228
00:18:22,620 --> 00:18:23,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why?</font>

229
00:18:31,840 --> 00:18:32,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why?!</font>

230
00:18:47,350 --> 00:18:49,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Grannny Tsunade...</font>

231
00:18:53,570 --> 00:18:54,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're still going to get up?</font>

232
00:18:59,150 --> 00:19:01,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just like our wager</font>

233
00:19:01,320 --> 00:19:05,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will definitely win
that unlucky necklace from you.</font>

234
00:19:08,580 --> 00:19:10,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

235
00:19:12,330 --> 00:19:14,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone won't do anything now.</font>

236
00:19:16,050 --> 00:19:20,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Enough... Don't protect me, Naruto.
Stop it!</font>

237
00:19:23,050 --> 00:19:26,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I told you that you'd die
if you were obstinate like that, right?</font>

238
00:19:26,810 --> 00:19:30,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you die, there will be no dreams,
no nothing.</font>

239
00:19:30,440 --> 00:19:33,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just get out of the way. Run away.</font>

240
00:19:35,020 --> 00:19:37,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph... It's okay.</font>

241
00:19:47,200 --> 00:19:48,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I...</font>

242
00:19:55,670 --> 00:19:57,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">until I become Hokage...</font>

243
00:19:58,260 --> 00:20:00,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I absolutely will not die!</font>

244
00:20:13,770 --> 00:20:16,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This way, I can hold on to you.
Here I go!</font>

245
00:20:23,450 --> 00:20:25,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the same Chakra movement
as before.</font>

246
00:20:26,450 --> 00:20:29,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, this is... different.</font>

247
00:20:30,910 --> 00:20:31,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see.</font>

248
00:20:33,000 --> 00:20:35,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In order to gain a hand
for suppressing Chakra,</font>

249
00:20:35,580 --> 00:20:36,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Shadow Clone...</font>

250
00:20:38,590 --> 00:20:40,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Compress Chakra and...</font>

251
00:20:41,880 --> 00:20:43,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">hold it completely.</font>

252
00:20:46,550 --> 00:20:47,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wha...?!</font>

253
00:20:47,550 --> 00:20:48,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-It can't be.</font>

254
00:20:50,890 --> 00:20:52,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rasengan!</font>

255
00:21:05,220 --> 00:21:10,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>I BELIEVE YOUR PROMISE ITS TRUE HEART TO GIVE ME COURAGE</b></font></font>

256
00:21:05,220 --> 00:21:10,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>I believe your promise, it's a true heart gives me courage</b></font></font>

257
00:21:10,220 --> 00:21:15,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ALWAYS I FEEL IT THE PRECIOUS TIME WITH YOU</b></font></font>

258
00:21:10,220 --> 00:21:15,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>always I feel it the precious time with you</b></font></font>

259
00:21:15,190 --> 00:21:20,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>tachidomatta kado ni</b></font></font>

260
00:21:15,190 --> 00:21:20,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>on your still shoulder</b></font></font>

261
00:21:20,000 --> 00:21:24,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>asu e mukau kaze wo kanjiteta</b></font></font>

262
00:21:20,000 --> 00:21:24,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>I feel the wind that blows towards tomorrow</b></font></font>

263
00:21:24,630 --> 00:21:30,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>machi no akari hoshikuzu mitai ni</b></font></font>

264
00:21:24,630 --> 00:21:30,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>the city lights are like pieces of stars</b></font></font>

265
00:21:30,570 --> 00:21:35,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>futari tsutsumu kedo</b></font></font>

266
00:21:30,570 --> 00:21:35,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>that hold us together</b></font></font>

267
00:21:35,240 --> 00:21:44,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>sorezore ni chigau kagayaki ga aru to</b></font></font>

268
00:21:35,240 --> 00:21:44,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>"each one of us glows differently"</b></font></font>

269
00:21:44,550 --> 00:21:47,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>warau kimi ga</b></font></font>

270
00:21:44,550 --> 00:21:47,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>you say laughingly</b></font></font>

271
00:21:47,430 --> 00:21:53,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ichiban mabushiku mieru yo</b></font></font>

272
00:21:47,430 --> 00:21:53,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>but you look most dazzling</b></font></font>

273
00:21:53,700 --> 00:21:58,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>yume wa ryuusei no you ni</b></font></font>

274
00:21:53,700 --> 00:21:58,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>like a comet</b></font></font>

275
00:21:58,130 --> 00:22:04,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ameagari no niji no you ni</b></font></font>

276
00:21:58,130 --> 00:22:04,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>like the rainbow after the storm</b></font></font>

277
00:22:04,280 --> 00:22:12,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>kono kokoro ni hikari wo tsuretekuru</b></font></font>

278
00:22:04,280 --> 00:22:12,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>you bring light into my heart</b></font></font>

279
00:22:12,480 --> 00:22:23,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>nayami tsuzukeru koto ga hitotsu no kotae ni naruyo</b></font></font>

280
00:22:12,480 --> 00:22:23,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>being lost can be the answer</b></font></font>

